        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#7B8AA3' }}>BOUNDARY · 边界清晰</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 520, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 20, paddingTop: 10 }}>
        <Box style={{ height: 380, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 20 }}>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.04)', border: '1px solid rgba(123,138,163,0.24)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#7B8AA3', fontWeight: '600' }}>边界说明</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#EAF0F8' }}>本次交付的边界说明</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#EAF0F8', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
                    <>· 真实出图出片需商业密钥与配额，质量需补做在线验收<br /><br />· 本地进程内队列无后台调度，失败任务不自动重排<br /><br />· 界面沿用既有工作台，本次未重做交互设计，仅统一视觉规范<br /><br />· 上述边界均已在验收方案中书面声明，验收时可逐条核对</>
                </Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#7B8AA3', marginTop: 'auto' }}>对应文档：验收方案 · 已知限制与风险表</Text>
