            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: 'rgba(51,112,255,0.12)', border: '1px solid rgba(51,112,255,0.35)', borderRadius: 12, padding: 22, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#3370FF', fontWeight: '600' }}>优先级排序</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: '600', color: '#EAF0F8' }}>下一步改进计划</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#EAF0F8', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>
                    <>P1 服务端健壮性<br /><span style={{ color: '#7B8AA3' }}>收窄宽泛异常捕获并记录日志；补齐外键级联，清理孤儿记录</span><br /><br />P1 前端体验<br /><span style={{ color: '#7B8AA3' }}>统一加载与错误态、客户端表单校验、操作反馈</span><br /><br />P2 移动端与暗色模式</>
                </Text>
